<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53505" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shorn smooth</i>, opp. rough, of
			cloths, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1514.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>chopped, sliced</i>, esp. of the leaves of the leek, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράσον κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.149
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eup.</u>
				2.123
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. κρόμμυα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					10.815
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κ</span>. abs., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				2.6.32
			</span></i>. (On the accent v. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.216
			</span></i>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
